content.text:
Now `_beginBlackout` reset lure? Maybe lureT=0, lureCd unaffected. Add doors etc. Also `_updateAI` escalation and `_updateFoxy`.

Edit `_updateAI`: currently:
```
const watching = this.camOpen && this.camMatches(name, a) && name === 'freddy';
...
a.timer -= dt;
if (a.timer <=0) {
 a.timer = a.interval*(...);
 const chance = a.level/20;
 ...
}
```
Change timer interval to pressure scale; chance include pressure. Also if camOpen and watching any? Keep Freddy only. Maybe also add a "camera sweep pressure" where watching a cam delays the character on that cam for all? But that would encourage staring at each cam. I'd keep Freddy only. But maybe add a small chance the animatronics "freeze when watched" only in their current cam for 2s? That is actually FNAF-ish? Not really. Keep.

Also improve atDoor behavior: if door closed and blockT <=0 retreat; if light on maybe no effect.

Add `this.timePressure()`.

Edit.

input.newString:
_updateAI(dt) {
  if (this.startDelay > 0) { this.startDelay -= dt; return; }
  const pressure = this.timePressure();
  for (const name in this.ai) {
    const a = this.ai[name];
    // Freddy is shy — he freezes if you are watching his room.
    const watching = this.camOpen && this.camMatches(name, a) && name === 'freddy';
    if (a.cooldown > 0) { a.cooldown -= dt; continue; }

    if (a.atDoor) {
      if (this.doors[a.side]) {
        a.blockT -= dt;
        if (a.blockT <= 0) this._retreat(a);
        continue;
      }
      a.attackT -= dt;
      if (a.attackT <= 0) {
        this._kill(name);
        return;
      }
      // breathing at the door
      if (Math.random() < dt * .55) this.audio.breath(a.side === 'left' ? -.75 : .75);
      continue;
    }

    if (watching) continue;
    a.timer -= dt;
    if (a.timer <= 0) {
      a.timer = (a.interval / (.82 + pressure * .18)) * (.82 + Math.random() * .5);
      const chance = Math.min(.82, (a.level / 20) * pressure);
      if (Math.random() < chance) {
        this._advance(a);
      } else if (Math.random() < .13) {
        // restless shuffle
        this.audio.step(a.side === 'left' ? -.65 : .65, 1);
      }
    }
  }
}

