```
Also handleCams calls `feed.setCam(game.cam)` and `updateActiveCam`; fine. Add updateCamAlerts in open/close/updateActive.

Implement `updateCamAlerts()`:
```
const motion = game.motionCams();
$$('.cam-sel').forEach(b => b.classList.toggle('alert', motion.has(b.dataset.cam)));
$$('.fp-hit').forEach(r => r.classList.toggle('motion', motion.has(r.dataset.cam) && r.dataset.cam !== game.cam));
