```
Actually should show motion for current camera. Also for current camera in map maybe active. Use motion on all.

Add `lastHud.motion` to avoid DOM work.

In updateHud, call updateCamAlerts maybe every frame but only if changed. Could compute signature. Simpler call updateCamAlerts every 250ms? We can add inside updateHud with signature. Let's do:
```
const motion = game.motionCams();
const sig = [...motion].sort().join()+game.cam;
if (force || sig !== lastHud.motion) { ... lastHud.motion = sig; }
```
Add in updateHud near cam state.

Also update lure UI in updateHud:
