content.text:
Add `_buildEnvironment` and `_glow` / `_contactShadow` helpers. Insert after `_initRenderer` or before resize. Also adjust renderer settings: exposure 1.06, shadow type, add environment. Let's modify `_initRenderer` first.

Current:
```
this.renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(...,2));
...
this.renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.0;
this.renderer.shadowMap.enabled = true;
...
this.scene = new THREE.Scene();
this.scene.background = new THREE.Color(0x050403);
this.scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x060504, 0.047);
...
```
Set exposure 1.08, shadow map, maybe `this.renderer.useLegacyLights = false`? In r159, legacy lights still default false? `renderer.useLegacyLights` deprecated at r155 and default false. Fine. Set `this.scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x070605, .032)` maybe less fog. Fog reduces depth; current scene looks flat due to fog. Lower to .035. Office small. Keep .038.

Add environment after scene. Let's modify.

